      "scope_note": "Development observation only. The single pre-registered probe removed only the bound independent term param4 (d2*x**5) and refit on the same 10000 training rows: delta_nmse = 7.18e-07, below the 1e-05 threshold, verdict 'contradicted' for removal-cost claim. All three arms converged. This does not establish held-out accuracy, physical necessity, optimality, generalization, or that the final artifact will pass any gate or match the forecast value."
